        <p class="text-muted">
          You must create an account to list accommodations or book reservations. You are responsible for safeguarding your login password and all activities under your account. You agree to provide accurate and truthful information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-4">
        <h4>3. Listings and Host Obligations</h4>
        <p class="text-muted">
          As a host, you represent that:
        </p>
        <ul class="text-muted">
          <li>You hold legitimate rights to host guests at the advertised property.</li>
          <li>Your pricing, photos, and house rules are transparent and accurate.</li>
          <li>You will honor confirmed reservations and respond promptly to booking requests.</li>
          <li>You cannot book your own listing.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-4">
        <h4>4. Reservations and Cancellations</h4>
        <p class="text-muted">
          Guests can request bookings with specified check-in/check-out dates. Once confirmed by the host, both parties are bound by the reservation. Guests may cancel their booking prior to check-in via their "My Trips" dashboard.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-4">
        <h4>5. Community Guidelines</h4>
        <p class="text-muted">
          All members must respect one another. Discrimination, harassment, fraudulent activity, and damage to property are strictly prohibited and will lead to permanent account suspension.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h4>6. Inquiries</h4>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
          For any legal inquiries regarding these terms, please email us at <a href="mailto:terms@wanderlust.com" class="text-danger text-decoration-none fw-semibold">terms@wanderlust.com</a>.
